  <worksheets>
    <worksheet name='Customer Pareto Chart'>
      <layout-options>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>DESCRIPTION
The Pareto Chart is one that ranks customers based on their sales and includes a cumulative percentage 
line that shows how fast total sales accumulate among the customers.

ANALYSIS/ BUSINESS PERSPECTIVE
This will show if indeed a small portion of the customers are responsible for the bulk of the sales. Those 
customers that contribute to the first 80% of sales can be the focus of retention efforts and campaigns 
designed to foster loyalty among them, while the others can be engaged in repeat purchase campaigns.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='Sample - Superstore' name='federated.0xgffwl0x9lrlw1g0nbqy1vzka5g' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.0xgffwl0x9lrlw1g0nbqy1vzka5g'>
            <column caption='cumulative sales%' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_2254853812928513]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='RUNNING_SUM(SUM([Sales]))/WINDOW_SUM(SUM([Sales]))'>
                <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
              </calculation>
            </column>
            <column datatype='string' name='[Customer Name]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column datatype='real' name='[Sales]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
            <column datatype='string' name='[Sub-Category]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[Customer Name]' derivation='None' name='[none:Customer Name:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[Sales]' derivation='Sum' name='[sum:Sales:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_2254853812928513]' derivation='User' name='[usr:Calculation_2254853812928513:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative'>
              <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
            </column-instance>
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.0xgffwl0x9lrlw1g0nbqy1vzka5g].[Action (Sub-Category)]'>
            <groupfilter function='level-members' level='[Sub-Category]' user:ui-action-filter='[Action2_42B9DF3D8CC0456E84D8509A0D9382AF]' user:ui-enumeration='all' user:ui-marker='enumerate' />
          </filter>
          <filter class='categorical' column='[federated.0xgffwl0x9lrlw1g0nbqy1vzka5g].[none:Customer Name:nk]'>
            <groupfilter function='level-members' level='[none:Customer Name:nk]' />
