    <worksheet name='KPI-Total Customers'>
      <layout-options>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>DESCRIPTION
The total number of unique customers that placed orders through the selected filters is represented by this KPI.

ANALYSIS / BUSINESS PERSPECTIVE
Total Customers is an indicator of customer coverage. Comparing the number of customers and sales will help managers determine whether the performance is because of the acquisition of new customers or increased spending of the current customers.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
