        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>DESCRIPTION
The KPI provides the total number of unique customer orders during the selected time frame.

ANALYSIS / BUSINESS PERSPECTIVE
With Total Orders, managers are able to get an idea of how many transactions occur. The comparison between orders, customers and sales will show any shifts in purchasing frequency and will help understand whether growth is achieved through the number of transactions or their value.</run>
