    <worksheet name='Regional Sales'>
      <layout-options>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>DESCRIPTION
This is the map that shows how the sales volume is geographically spread among the states or 
regions. The colour or mark size indicates the sales performance whereas the profit can be shown in 
the tooltip.  

ANALYSIS/BUSINESS PERSPECTIVE
With the help of the map, the managers can figure out the geographic zones that have high or low 
demand. Areas with high sales can be focused on retention and expansion while poor-performing areas 
need to be checked out.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
