The Total Customers KPI represents the total unique customers placing orders under the selected filters.

ANALYSIS/BUSINESS PERSPECTIVE
Total Customers KPI gives a metric of customer reach. Managers will be able to compare changes in the customer base with changes in sales to see if their performance depends on the attraction of new customers or increased spending by current customers.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
