          <formatted-text>
            <run>DESCRIPTION
The above is a horizontal bar chart showing the total sales from three different customer segments that include consumer, corporate, and home office customer segments. The length of the bar shows the proportion of sales in each segment.

ANALYSIS/BUSINESS PERSPECTIVE
The graph will assist the marketing department in identifying the best segment in terms of customer demand. The best performing segment can be retained and given personalized offers, while the other segments can be given special offers.</run>
