    <worksheet name='Sales and profit by region'>
      <layout-options>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>DESCRIPTION
The graph provides the opportunity to compare sales and profits within the different geographic 
segments and enables us to understand whether high-sales segments are also profitable.

ANALYSIS / BUSINESS PERSPECTIVE
The comparison allows managers to differentiate between volume and profit. High-sales regions with 
lower profits would need to be analyzed for reasons for such performance; it could be because of discounting, product mix, higher transportation expenses, etc. Both high-sales and profit regions deserve investments in marketing and inventory.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
